{"id": "wwdc2017-247", "language": "eng", "source": "https://developer.apple.com/videos/play/wwdc2017/247", "wordCount": 758, "segments": [{"start": 29.0, "text": "Whether looking for the"}, {"start": 30.0, "text": "latest TV show to watch or the"}, {"start": 32.0, "text": "best place to grab lunch, you"}, {"start": 33.0, "text": "rely on the people around you"}, {"start": 35.0, "text": "for recommendations."}, {"start": 36.0, "text": "By offering the ability to share"}, {"start": 38.0, "text": "on Your App, you can empower"}, {"start": 40.0, "text": "your users to give contextual"}, {"start": 41.0, "text": "recommendations."}, {"start": 42.0, "text": "But there are some important"}, {"start": 44.0, "text": "things to consider before you"}, {"start": 45.0, "text": "offer the ability to share."}, {"start": 49.0, "text": "First is the content."}, {"start": 50.0, "text": "In Your App, what will you want"}, {"start": 52.0, "text": "your user to share?"}, {"start": 53.0, "text": "Is it an image or a video, or"}, {"start": 55.0, "text": "maybe even an experience that"}, {"start": 56.0, "text": "they've had in Your App?"}, {"start": 59.0, "text": "Next is placement."}, {"start": 60.0, "text": "Where in Your App is the best"}, {"start": 61.0, "text": "place to offer the ability to"}, {"start": 63.0, "text": "share?"}, {"start": 64.0, "text": "If you share from a certain"}, {"start": 65.0, "text": "screen, is it contextual?"}, {"start": 67.0, "text": "Will the user know exactly what"}, {"start": 68.0, "text": "will be passed to the recipient?"}, {"start": 71.0, "text": "Timing is another important"}, {"start": 73.0, "text": "aspect to building a great"}, {"start": 74.0, "text": "sharing experience."}, {"start": 76.0, "text": "It needs to be, when a user is"}, {"start": 77.0, "text": "completely connected to the"}, {"start": 78.0, "text": "content they are wanting to"}, {"start": 79.0, "text": "share; and at that moment,"}, {"start": 81.0, "text": "think, \"My friend Kate would"}, {"start": 82.0, "text": "love this.\""}, {"start": 84.0, "text": "The developers of Crossy Road"}, {"start": 86.0, "text": "have a great implementation that"}, {"start": 87.0, "text": "has narrowed all three of these"}, {"start": 88.0, "text": "areas."}, {"start": 89.0, "text": "They started with an experience."}, {"start": 92.0, "text": "Now, it's quite common to share"}, {"start": 93.0, "text": "your progress in a game, but"}, {"start": 95.0, "text": "losing in Crossy Road is"}, {"start": 96.0, "text": "actually quite comical."}, {"start": 97.0, "text": "They quickly realized that"}, {"start": 99.0, "text": "people are going to want to share that moment and created a"}, {"start": 101.0, "text": "photograph representation and"}, {"start": 103.0, "text": "previewed it, ready for sharing."}, {"start": 105.0, "text": "The timing, content and"}, {"start": 106.0, "text": "placement were all great."}, {"start": 108.0, "text": "Think about the user of Your"}, {"start": 109.0, "text": "App."}, {"start": 110.0, "text": "When are they most emotionally"}, {"start": 111.0, "text": "attached to the experience and"}, {"start": 112.0, "text": "going to want to share it?"}, {"start": 115.0, "text": "Another important aspect of"}, {"start": 116.0, "text": "sharing is placement."}, {"start": 118.0, "text": "It doesn't make sense for a"}, {"start": 119.0, "text": "sharing button in a list view"}, {"start": 120.0, "text": "here; but on a detail view, it"}, {"start": 123.0, "text": "does. As I find a session I'm"}, {"start": 125.0, "text": "interested in, I might think of"}, {"start": 126.0, "text": "someone else that could be"}, {"start": 127.0, "text": "interested and can very quickly"}, {"start": 129.0, "text": "share it."}, {"start": 130.0, "text": "The way you offer the ability to"}, {"start": 133.0, "text": "share in Your App is with an"}, {"start": 134.0, "text": "action button."}, {"start": 135.0, "text": "This is the universal control"}, {"start": 137.0, "text": "used by all apps to access"}, {"start": 138.0, "text": "sharing."}, {"start": 139.0, "text": "A great place for an action"}, {"start": 140.0, "text": "button in a detail view like"}, {"start": 142.0, "text": "this is in the title bar."}, {"start": 144.0, "text": "It helps communicate to the user"}, {"start": 145.0, "text": "that you can share all the"}, {"start": 147.0, "text": "information in this view."}, {"start": 149.0, "text": "On tapping that button, you can"}, {"start": 151.0, "text": "call a UIActivityViewController."}, {"start": 153.0, "text": "This will display the user's"}, {"start": 155.0, "text": "sharing options."}, {"start": 156.0, "text": "By default, the system has some"}, {"start": 158.0, "text": "built-in sharing options, like"}, {"start": 159.0, "text": "messages, mail and notes; but"}, {"start": 161.0, "text": "other options will populate here"}, {"start": 163.0, "text": "from apps that have implemented"}, {"start": 165.0, "text": "a share extension."}, {"start": 166.0, "text": "When creating the"}, {"start": 167.0, "text": "UIActivityViewController, you"}, {"start": 169.0, "text": "can parse in pretty much any"}, {"start": 170.0, "text": "object, like a string, image or"}, {"start": 173.0, "text": "URL."}, {"start": 174.0, "text": "But the best way to share the"}, {"start": 175.0, "text": "content of Your App is to use"}, {"start": 177.0, "text": "the universal link."}, {"start": 178.0, "text": "A universal link looks like a"}, {"start": 179.0, "text": "URL, but instead launches Your"}, {"start": 181.0, "text": "App."}, {"start": 184.0, "text": "At this stage, you might be"}, {"start": 185.0, "text": "asking, \"Why share a URL?"}, {"start": 187.0, "text": "This is not a Web page.\""}, {"start": 189.0, "text": "Well, you have to consider the"}, {"start": 190.0, "text": "person receiving the shared"}, {"start": 191.0, "text": "information."}, {"start": 192.0, "text": "They may not have Your App"}, {"start": 193.0, "text": "installed; so when tapping a"}, {"start": 195.0, "text": "universal link when Your App is"}, {"start": 197.0, "text": "not installed, it will fall back"}, {"start": 198.0, "text": "to Safari, making it possible"}, {"start": 200.0, "text": "for people with Your App to"}, {"start": 202.0, "text": "share content with new people"}, {"start": 203.0, "text": "that do not need Your App to"}, {"start": 204.0, "text": "view the content."}, {"start": 207.0, "text": "Then if a new user receives a"}, {"start": 208.0, "text": "link to the content in Your App,"}, {"start": 210.0, "text": "an app banner can be displayed"}, {"start": 211.0, "text": "in Safari, and it's a great way"}, {"start": 213.0, "text": "to increase awareness of"}, {"start": 214.0, "text": "innovative experience to draw"}, {"start": 216.0, "text": "new users of Your App."}, {"start": 219.0, "text": "Another way you can increase the"}, {"start": 220.0, "text": "sharing experience for the"}, {"start": 221.0, "text": "recipient is to use Mockup in"}, {"start": 223.0, "text": "Open Graph."}, {"start": 224.0, "text": "Then the content shared in"}, {"start": 225.0, "text": "iMessage can be displayed in a"}, {"start": 226.0, "text": "rich format; so instead of"}, {"start": 228.0, "text": "looking like this, it can look"}, {"start": 230.0, "text": "like this -- with an image"}, {"start": 232.0, "text": "preview and title."}, {"start": 234.0, "text": "The recipient of this message is"}, {"start": 235.0, "text": "much more likely to tap and"}, {"start": 236.0, "text": "follow this link."}, {"start": 239.0, "text": "So in summary, think about the"}, {"start": 240.0, "text": "content and experiences in Your"}, {"start": 242.0, "text": "App. What will your user like to"}, {"start": 244.0, "text": "share; and when is the most"}, {"start": 246.0, "text": "meaningful time to share?"}, {"start": 248.0, "text": "Do they know enough about the"}, {"start": 249.0, "text": "content to want to share it?"}, {"start": 251.0, "text": "Use the action button to launch"}, {"start": 253.0, "text": "sharing and consider the"}, {"start": 254.0, "text": "placement of that button for"}, {"start": 255.0, "text": "context."}, {"start": 256.0, "text": "Universal links will work with"}, {"start": 258.0, "text": "recipients that don't have Your"}, {"start": 259.0, "text": "App, and app banners can guide"}, {"start": 261.0, "text": "them to Your App."}, {"start": 263.0, "text": "Finally, mock up your Web page"}, {"start": 264.0, "text": "with Open Graph for rich sharing"}, {"start": 266.0, "text": "in iMessage."}, {"start": 268.0, "text": "For more information, see the"}, {"start": 270.0, "text": "resources section of this video."}, {"start": 272.0, "text": "Thank you, and feel free to"}]}